        ],
        "text_sha256": "968d44148c00e238b22d719aa94222c5bfa3260c9fd32c6736577c50ed726ad3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "name": "诗文身份",
      "text": "**7｜诗文身份**  \nG13袭人短札淘汰；G14迎春绝命诗/信淘汰；无作者挽诗。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          547,
