          22895
        ],
        "text_sha256": "f42dbecc678adfc1385c35c40470ab0bba809b9577a6928b5ff17b137b4613e3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "name": "应删",
      "text": "**13｜应删**  \n长告别、血书、迎春遗诗、全家集体悼词。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          565,
