          22972
        ],
        "text_sha256": "fce0ae558bf16630b75f7dd8b6c32397787c28d54c80b3f62195b16ae8dbdc3e"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "name": "L3",
      "text": "**14｜L3**  \n双线交叉可加强：一边“有始有终”离开，一边“无权收尸/遗物”的消息进入。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
